{"3952070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nitro Turtles", "steam_appid": 3952070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro Turtles is a racing game about super fast turtles! Reach insane speeds with awesome shell-attached gadgets, compete in crazy races with friends, and sprint across the finish line to claim ultimate turtle victory! To be the fastest turtle around, you'll need to master shell gadget usage, learn every shortcut imaginable, and maybe even consider using performance-enhancing seaweed*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra High-Tech Shell Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use awesome shell-attached gadgets like the shellicopter, seagull, bubble, urchin, and performance-enhancing seaweed*<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/d6ccdd794135a85b5e127a9bdb88ae55.poster.avif?t=1773154839\" aria-label=\"Nitro Turtles using shell gadgets. \" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/d6ccdd794135a85b5e127a9bdb88ae55.webm?t=1773154839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/d6ccdd794135a85b5e127a9bdb88ae55.mp4?t=1773154839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awesome Tropical Race Courses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through the Rainbow Reef, the Sandstone Spires, the Cracked Shell Crater, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/c9f554da31acc6130b49e0f67f43e4ef.poster.avif?t=1773154839\" aria-label=\"Nitro Turtles racing through tropical environments.\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/c9f554da31acc6130b49e0f67f43e4ef.webm?t=1773154839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/c9f554da31acc6130b49e0f67f43e4ef.mp4?t=1773154839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against your friends with online, split screen, or LAN multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also play against bots if you have no friends :(</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cool shell gadgets to reach speeds turtles never thought possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in 9 vibrant and unique courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun / time trials mode with online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Performance-enhancing seaweed has not been tested for safety and likely has numerous side effects :O</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro Turtles is a racing game about super fast turtles! Reach insane speeds with awesome shell-attached gadgets, compete in crazy races with friends, and sprint across the finish line to claim ultimate turtle victory! To be the fastest turtle around, you'll need to master shell gadget usage, learn every shortcut imaginable, and maybe even consider using performance-enhancing seaweed*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra High-Tech Shell Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use awesome shell-attached gadgets like the shellicopter, seagull, bubble, urchin, and performance-enhancing seaweed*<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p